  (301, 'You could fit all the planets in the solar system between the Earth and the Moon, with space to spare.'),
  (302, 'The world''s quietest room is at Microsoft''s headquarters in Redmond — at -20.35 dB, it''s so quiet that people hallucinate after just a few minutes.'),
  (303, 'More Monopoly money is printed each year than real US dollars.'),
  (304, 'There are at least 10 times more bacterial cells in your body than human cells.'),
  (305, 'The longest recorded flight of a chicken is 13 seconds.'),
  (306, 'Apples, pears, and roses all belong to the same botanical family (Rosaceae).'),
  (307, 'The average person blinks about 20 times a minute — but only 7 times per minute while looking at a screen.'),
  (308, 'The Milky Way galaxy contains an estimated 100 to 400 billion stars.'),
  (309, 'Winston Churchill was born in a ladies'' cloakroom during a party.'),
  (310, 'Carrots were originally purple — they were bred to be orange in the 17th century in the Netherlands.'),
  (311, 'Newborn babies recognize the smell of their mother''s amniotic fluid and find it calming.'),
  (312, 'You can''t hum while holding your nose closed.'),
