  (425, 'The world''s largest desert rose crystal was discovered in Mexico — a single selenite crystal 11 meters long.'),
  (426, 'Antarctica is the only continent with no time zone — researchers just use the time zone of their home country.'),
  (427, 'Grapes, when placed in a microwave, produce plasma — a fourth state of matter.'),
  (428, 'Emus and ostriches can''t fly, but ostriches are the fastest running birds, reaching 45 mph.'),
  (429, 'The Velvet Underground''s debut album reportedly sold only 30,000 copies initially, but almost everyone who bought it formed a band.'),
  (430, 'A single teaspoon of soil contains more microorganisms than there are people on Earth.'),
  (431, 'The Titanic sank in under three hours — the Carpathia took nearly four hours to arrive.'),
  (432, 'Horses can sleep both standing up and lying down, but only dream during the latter.'),
  (433, 'The human body literally glows in the dark — bioluminescence from metabolic processes — but the light is 1,000 times too faint for human eyes to detect.'),
  (434, 'There are more atoms in a teaspoon of water than grains of sand on all Earth''s beaches.'),
  (435, 'Sharks are the only animals known to never develop cancer in the wild.'),
